<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Webkernel and Numerimondes: software, platforms and digital infrastructure.">
  <title>{{ title }} · Webkernel</title>
  <link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/geist-sans.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/geist-mono.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="head" id="head">
    <div class="topbar"><div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Webkernel home"><picture data-theme-picture><source srcset="/assets/branding/webkernel-logo-dark.webp" type="image/webp" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"><img class="brand-logo" src="/assets/branding/webkernel-logo-light.webp" alt="Webkernel" width="181" height="40" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></picture></a>
      <span class="grow"></span>
      <div class="search"><label><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.8"></circle><path d="m16 16 5 5"></path></svg><input type="search" placeholder="Search docs and packages" aria-label="Search docs and packages" autocomplete="off"><kbd>/</kbd></label></div>
      <a class="ext" href="#explore">Get started <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"></path></svg></a>
    </div></div>
    <div class="subbar"><div class="wrap">
      <nav class="subnav grow" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="active" href="/" aria-current="page">Get started</a>
        <a href="/#environment">Environment</a><a href="/#concepts">Concepts</a>
        <a href="/#build">Build</a><a href="/#packages">Packages</a>
        <a href="/#components">Components</a><a href="/#docs">Documentation</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="subbar-controls">
        <div class="meta"><span><span class="dot"></span> Request {{ request_time }} ms</span></div>
        <details class="language-switcher"><summary><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 0 1 0 20M12 2a15 15 0 0 0 0 20"></path></svg> EN <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path></svg></summary><nav aria-label="Language"><a href="/">English</a><a href="/about">Français</a></nav></details>
        <button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle" data-theme-toggle role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><span></span></button>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </header>
  <main class="layout"><div class="multipage-content">
    <div data-multipage-active="start">
      <section id="explore" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Explore Webkernel</p>
        <h2 id="explore-title">Built to be understood.</h2>
        <div class="story-grid">
          <a class="story" href="/#concepts"><img src="/assets/art/architecture-unsplash-640.webp" srcset="/assets/art/architecture-unsplash-320.webp 320w, /assets/art/architecture-unsplash-640.webp 640w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 120px, 33vw" alt="Sunlit concrete arches" width="640" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><small>01 / Architecture</small><h3>Understand the foundations</h3><p>Request lifecycle, performance budgets, and domain boundaries.</p></a>
          <a class="story" href="/#build"><img src="/assets/art/workshop-unsplash-640.webp" srcset="/assets/art/workshop-unsplash-320.webp 320w, /assets/art/workshop-unsplash-640.webp 640w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 120px, 33vw" alt="Metal components on engineering blueprints" width="640" height="427" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><small>02 / Development</small><h3>Build your application</h3><p>Routes, views, and the frontend tools that bring them together.</p></a>
          <a class="story" href="/#docs"><img src="/assets/art/library-unsplash-640.webp" srcset="/assets/art/library-unsplash-320.webp 320w, /assets/art/library-unsplash-640.webp 640w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 120px, 33vw" alt="Wooden bookshelves at a library" width="640" height="427" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><small>03 / Reference</small><h3>Get into the details</h3><p>Documentation shipped with each installed package.</p></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <nav class="quick-links" aria-label="Quick links"><span>Quick links</span><a class="btn" href="/#environment">Check your environment <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="btn" href="/#build">Your first route <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="btn" href="/about">About Numerimondes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav>
      <section id="environment"><p class="eyebrow">Numerimondes</p><h2>Technology under your control.</h2><p class="lede">Independent software, systems and digital infrastructure for organisations that want control of their tools and their data.</p></section>
      <section id="concepts"><p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p><h2>One ecosystem. Separate runtimes.</h2><p class="lede">Web, APIs, mobile, desktop, games and real-time systems share contracts and tooling while each profile keeps the runtime its constraints require.</p></section>
      <section id="build"><p class="eyebrow">Development</p><h2>Build for the work at hand.</h2><p class="lede">Routes and views stay close to the application. Production views compile into the binary; development tools are designed for a short edit-and-refresh loop.</p></section>
      <section id="packages"><p class="eyebrow">Packages</p><h2>Small, visible dependencies.</h2><p class="lede">Use established Rust components where they fit, with explicit ownership of configuration, storage and deployment.</p></section>
      <section id="components"><p class="eyebrow">Components</p><h2>Reusable application building blocks.</h2></section>
      <section id="docs"><p class="eyebrow">Reference</p><h2>Documentation that travels with the platform.</h2></section>
    </div>
  </div></main>
  <footer><div class="wrap"><picture data-theme-picture><source srcset="/assets/branding/numerimondes-logo-dark.webp" type="image/webp" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"><img src="/assets/branding/numerimondes-logo-light.webp" alt="Numerimondes" width="152" height="24" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><span>Webkernel by Numerimondes SARL AU · Casablanca</span></div></footer>
  <script>
    const toggle = document.querySelector('[data-theme-toggle]');
    const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme');
    if (savedTheme) document.documentElement.dataset.theme = savedTheme;
    toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const nextTheme = document.documentElement.dataset.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
      document.documentElement.dataset.theme = nextTheme;
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-checked', String(nextTheme === 'dark'));
      localStorage.setItem('theme', nextTheme);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
